# Class-table features are rules text unless an explicit PCGen numeric grant is present.
Fey Adept Shadowmark Dice (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_DICE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_DICE|floor((SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_LEVEL+1)/2)	DESC:%SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_DICE d6 shadowmark damage when its conditions are met; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Fey Adept Shadowmark Die Size (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_DIE_SIZE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_DIE_SIZE|6	DESC:%SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_DIE_SIZE sides per shadowmark damage die; modified by Greater Shadowmark; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Fey Adept Shadow Points (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOW_POINTS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOW_POINTS|max(1,CHA+floor(SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_LEVEL/2))	DESC:%SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOW_POINTS shadow point capacity; Charisma-based; refills when all spell points are regained; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Fey Adept Shadowmark Penalty (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_PENALTY|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_PENALTY|1+floor((SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_LEVEL-1)/6)	DESC:%SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_SHADOWMARK_PENALTY magnitude of target Will penalty against your sphere effects for one minute; does not stack with itself; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Fey Adept Master Illusionist Rounds (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_MASTER_ILLUSIONIST_ROUNDS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_MASTER_ILLUSIONIST_ROUNDS|max(1,floor(SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_LEVEL/2))	DESC:%SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_MASTER_ILLUSIONIST_ROUNDS rounds an illusion remains after concentration ends; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Fey Adept Truesight Uses (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_TRUESIGHT_USES|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_TRUESIGHT_USES|floor(SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_LEVEL/4)	DESC:%SPHERES_FEY_ADEPT_TRUESIGHT_USES uses per day of truesight from level 4; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
